<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT-IMSA lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-IMSA lowered.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican brokerage Banamex-Accival lowered its rating on conglomerate Grupo IMSA SA to neutral from a buy, the brokerage said in a report on Monday.</p>
<p>Analysts Arturo Espinosa and Rafael Urquia said they lowered the rating following IMSA shares' 14 percent gain in the month of May. So far this year, the shares have racked up a 31 percent gain, they said.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
</text>
